 confined in-tree local packages. Older consumers reject the new portable version explicitly.\n\nThe local CLI keeps the developer-selected runtime. Capture and runtime admission check bounded caller and owned-copy source currency, native pin/state/Git/NAR joins, and root/local manifests. Each operation admits the current native toolchain, including reuse of an installed graph. Admission rejects mixed native pin/state layouts before and after the native commands, including companion workspace-state files, symlinks, FIFOs and directories. Typed transactions share the existing root locks and external registry, preserve original native-state bytes, permissions and absence, and retain foreign changes for inspection. Foreground commands inherit the ownership locks and restore projected pins before returning after signals.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Original Linux Swift 5.2.5: default and read-only external selectors, cold capture/prefetch, a real installed Git release update from 1.0.0 to 1.0.1, build/test/clean/rebuild, and uninstall. Installed execution performs no additional controlled-origin requests.\n- Pure Nix project/XCTest and all four declared products; executable, static-library consumer and dynamic-library consumer produce 42. Permanent SDK and CI matrix use the original archive with ordinary loader/header relocation.\n- Native/pure regressions for portable formats 4, 6, 7 and 8 across Swift 3.0.2, 3.1.1, 4.0.3, 4.1.3, 4.2.4 and 5.1.5.\n- 234 packaged Python tests and 33 Nix codec checks, including interrupted first/replacement/uninstall transactions, foreign controls and data, maximum-size backup/envelope boundaries, source mutations/FIFOs/oversize, current-toolchain admission, inherited FDs and forwarded signals.\n\nThe new adapter's measured point is Linux Swift 5.2.5 / SwiftPM 5.2.0. Branch/revision-only pins, registry/binary dependencies, explicit-null native selectors and SDK-bound CLI mode remain outside its supported domain. Pure builds can select an explicit SDK. Darwin and release intervals are not inferred from this fixture.\n"},"releases":{"nodes":[{"tagName":"v0.1.11","isDraft":false,"isPrerelease":false,"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T07:35:54Z","tagCommit":{"oid":"4abf86f38defbe0e3a928b532921202ce3e0dcc5"},"releaseAssets":{"nodes":[{"name":"release-manifest.json","size":206,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.11/release-manifest.json"},{"name":"source.tar.gz","size":306473,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.11/source.tar.gz"},{"name":"SHA256SUMS","size":168,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.11/SHA256SUMS"}]}},{"tagName":"v0.1.10","isDraft":false,"isPrerelease":false,"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T01:56:25Z","tagCommit":{"oid":"27d6432c583f518bf1f466660e3bcccb1623362e"},"releaseAssets":{"nodes":[{"name":"release-manifest.json","size":206,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.10/release-manifest.json"},{"name":"SHA256SUMS","size":168,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.10/SHA256SUMS"},{"name":"source.tar.gz","size":267280,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.10/source.tar.gz"}]}},{"tagName":"v0.1.9","isDraft":false,"isPrerelease":false,"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T23:19:11Z","tagCommit":{"oid":"d760de40ae2935ed88ee376881d0c72ee7562590"},"releaseAssets":{"nodes":[{"name":"SHA256SUMS","size":168,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.9/SHA256SUMS"},{"name":"source.tar.gz","size":249626,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.9/source.tar.gz"},{"name":"release-manifest.json","size":205,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/nix-purifiers/swiftpm-purifier/releases/download/v0.1.9/release-manifest.json"}]}},{"tagName":"v0.1.8","isDraft"